{"id":"moda","lemma":"moda","pos":"noun","rank":1526,"glosses":["fashion","fad","mode"],"ipa":"/ˈmoda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"modas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-moda.wav","examples":[{"text":"La moda cambia rápidamente.","en":"Fashions change quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460794"},{"text":"Ésta es la última moda.","en":"This is the latest fashion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38184"},{"text":"Tu falda está pasada de moda.","en":"Your skirt is out of fashion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581654"},{"text":"Esos zapatos están pasados de moda.","en":"Those shoes are old fashioned.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306345"},{"text":"Tom no tiene gusto para la moda.","en":"Tom has no sense of style.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806045"}]}